# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Learn which time-based usage fields in the IBM Quantum Compute API to disregard, and which resource unit (RU) fields replace them."
msgstr "Ketahui medan penggunaan berasaskan masa yang mana dalam IBM Quantum Compute API yang perlu diabaikan, dan medan unit sumber (RU) yang mana menggantikannya."

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Migrate to resource units (RUs) in the IBM Quantum Compute API"
msgstr "Berhijrah kepada unit sumber (RU) dalam IBM Quantum Compute API"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Migrate to resource units (RUs) in the IBM Quantum Compute API {#migrate-to-resource-units-rus-in-the-ibm-quantum-compute-api}"
msgstr "Berhijrah kepada unit sumber (RU) dalam IBM Quantum Compute API {#migrate-to-resource-units-rus-in-the-ibm-quantum-compute-api}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Quantum&reg; Platform now measures usage in resource units (RUs). An RU is the unit that IBM Quantum uses to measure and bill the usage of all workloads. Before this change, the platform measured usage as QPU time in seconds or milliseconds. For more information about RUs, see [Resource units](/guides/plans-overview#resource-units).\n"
msgstr "IBM Quantum&reg; Platform kini mengukur penggunaan dalam unit sumber (RU). RU ialah unit yang digunakan oleh IBM Quantum untuk mengukur dan membilkan penggunaan semua beban kerja. Sebelum perubahan ini, platform mengukur penggunaan sebagai masa QPU dalam saat atau milisaat. Untuk maklumat lanjut tentang RU, lihat [Unit sumber](/guides/plans-overview#resource-units).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Today, the API returns two sets of fields: the old time fields and the new RU fields. Your integration continues to work. In a future release, IBM Quantum will remove the time fields. Change your integration to read the RU fields now.\n"
msgstr "Pada masa ini, API mengembalikan dua set medan: medan masa lama dan medan RU baharu. Integrasi anda terus berfungsi. Dalam keluaran akan datang, IBM Quantum akan mengalih keluar medan masa tersebut. Ubah integrasi anda untuk membaca medan RU sekarang.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This guide uses these terms:\n"
msgstr "Panduan ini menggunakan istilah berikut:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Workload**: A job, a session, a batch, or a function run.\n"
msgstr "**Beban kerja**: Sebuah kerja, session, batch, atau larian fungsi.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**QPU workload**: A job, a session, or a batch. A QPU workload runs only on a QPU.\n"
msgstr "**Beban kerja QPU**: Sebuah kerja, session, atau batch. Beban kerja QPU hanya berjalan pada QPU.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Function workload**: A function run. A function workload can use classical compute and an execution license, and it can also use a QPU.\n"
msgstr "**Beban kerja fungsi**: Larian fungsi. Beban kerja fungsi boleh menggunakan pengkomputeran klasik dan lesen pelaksanaan, dan ia juga boleh menggunakan QPU.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Session**: A group of jobs that run together on one QPU.\n"
msgstr "**Session**: Sekumpulan kerja yang berjalan bersama pada satu QPU.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Instance**: A service instance. It owns workloads and has usage limits.\n"
msgstr "**Instans**: Instans perkhidmatan. Ia memiliki beban kerja dan mempunyai had penggunaan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Plan**: The service plan of an account. It sets the usage limits for all instances in the account.\n"
msgstr "**Pelan**: Pelan perkhidmatan bagi sesebuah akaun. Ia menetapkan had penggunaan untuk semua instans dalam akaun tersebut.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"  This guide uses version 0.57.2 of the [OpenAPI spec](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/api/openapi.json).\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"  Panduan ini menggunakan versi 0.57.2 bagi [spesifikasi OpenAPI](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/api/openapi.json).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  The `IBM-API-Version` header value must be `2026-04-15` or a later supported API version.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"  Nilai pengepala `IBM-API-Version` mestilah `2026-04-15` atau versi API yang disokong yang lebih baharu.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Summary {#summary}"
msgstr "Ringkasan {#summary}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Endpoint | Disregard | Read instead |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- |\n"
"| `GET /v1/jobs`, `GET /v1/jobs/{id}/metrics` | `usage.qpu_charge_time_seconds` | `usage.value` |\n"
"| `GET /v1/workloads` | `workloads[].usage.qpu_charge_time_seconds` | `workloads[].usage.value` |\n"
"| `POST /v1/sessions`, `GET /v1/sessions/{id}` | `elapsed_time` | `usage.value` |\n"
"| `GET /v1/instances/usage` | `usage_consumed_seconds`, `usage_limit_seconds`, `usage_allocation_seconds` | `usage_consumed_ru`, `usage_limit_ru`, `usage_allocation_ru` |\n"
"| `GET /v1/accounts/{id}` | `plans[].usage_limit_seconds`, `plans[].usage_allocation_seconds`, `plans[].unallocated_usage_seconds` | `plans[].usage_limit_ru`, `plans[].usage_allocation_ru`, `plans[].unallocated_usage_ru` |\n"
"| Resource Controller API: Create, update, and read service instances | `instance_limit_seconds`, `usage_allocation_seconds` | `instance_limit_ru`, `usage_allocation_ru` |\n"
"| `GET /v1/analytics/usage`, `GET /v1/analytics/usage_grouped`, `GET /v1/analytics/usage_grouped_by_date` | Each usage field in milliseconds | The matching field with the `_ru` suffix |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Endpoint | Abaikan | Baca sebagai ganti |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- |\n"
"| `GET /v1/jobs`, `GET /v1/jobs/{id}/metrics` | `usage.qpu_charge_time_seconds` | `usage.value` |\n"
"| `GET /v1/workloads` | `workloads[].usage.qpu_charge_time_seconds` | `workloads[].usage.value` |\n"
"| `POST /v1/sessions`, `GET /v1/sessions/{id}` | `elapsed_time` | `usage.value` |\n"
"| `GET /v1/instances/usage` | `usage_consumed_seconds`, `usage_limit_seconds`, `usage_allocation_seconds` | `usage_consumed_ru`, `usage_limit_ru`, `usage_allocation_ru` |\n"
"| `GET /v1/accounts/{id}` | `plans[].usage_limit_seconds`, `plans[].usage_allocation_seconds`, `plans[].unallocated_usage_seconds` | `plans[].usage_limit_ru`, `plans[].usage_allocation_ru`, `plans[].unallocated_usage_ru` |\n"
"| Resource Controller API: Cipta, kemas kini dan baca instans perkhidmatan | `instance_limit_seconds`, `usage_allocation_seconds` | `instance_limit_ru`, `usage_allocation_ru` |\n"
"| `GET /v1/analytics/usage`, `GET /v1/analytics/usage_grouped`, `GET /v1/analytics/usage_grouped_by_date` | Setiap medan penggunaan dalam milisaat | Medan yang sepadan dengan akhiran `_ru` |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The sections that follow give the details for each endpoint.\n"
msgstr "Bahagian berikut memberikan butiran bagi setiap endpoint.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Jobs {#jobs}"
msgstr "Kerja {#jobs}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Endpoints: `GET /v1/jobs` and `GET /v1/jobs/{id}/metrics`.\n"
msgstr "Endpoint: `GET /v1/jobs` dan `GET /v1/jobs/{id}/metrics`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Disregard | Read instead |\n"
"| --- | --- |\n"
"| `usage.qpu_charge_time_seconds` | `usage.value` |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Abaikan | Baca sebagai ganti |\n"
"| --- | --- |\n"
"| `usage.qpu_charge_time_seconds` | `usage.value` |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The `usage` object also has these fields:\n"
msgstr "Objek `usage` juga mempunyai medan berikut:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`usage.unit`: The unit of `usage.value`. The value is always `\"resource_units\"`.\n"
msgstr "`usage.unit`: Unit bagi `usage.value`. Nilainya sentiasa `\"resource_units\"`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`usage.status`: The billing status. The value is `\"pending\"` or `\"complete\"`. If the status is `\"pending\"`, the platform can still change the value. Do not use a pending value as the final usage.\n"
msgstr "`usage.status`: Status pembilan. Nilainya ialah `\"pending\"` atau `\"complete\"`. Jika statusnya `\"pending\"`, platform masih boleh mengubah nilai tersebut. Jangan gunakan nilai pending sebagai penggunaan akhir.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`usage.details[]`: The usage for each billing metric. The `value` of each entry is in RUs.\n"
msgstr "`usage.details[]`: Penggunaan bagi setiap metrik pembilan. `value` bagi setiap entri adalah dalam RU.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example:\n"
msgstr "Example:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The field `usage.details[].metric.value` is not the usage in RUs. It is the quantity of the metric that the platform used to calculate the RUs. Each metric has its own unit. For example, the unit of a QPU metric is seconds. For the usage, read `usage.details[].value`.\n"
msgstr "Medan `usage.details[].metric.value` bukan penggunaan dalam RU. Ia ialah kuantiti metrik yang digunakan oleh platform untuk mengira RU. Setiap metrik mempunyai unitnya sendiri. Contohnya, unit bagi metrik QPU ialah saat. Untuk penggunaan, baca `usage.details[].value`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Workloads {#workloads}"
msgstr "Beban kerja {#workloads}"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Endpoint: `GET /v1/workloads`.\n"
msgstr "Endpoint: `GET /v1/workloads`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Each item in `workloads[]` has a `usage` object. This object has the same fields as the `usage` object of a job.\n"
msgstr "Setiap item dalam `workloads[]` mempunyai objek `usage`. Objek ini mempunyai medan yang sama seperti objek `usage` bagi sesebuah kerja.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Disregard | Read instead |\n"
"| --- | --- |\n"
"| `workloads[].usage.qpu_charge_time_seconds` | `workloads[].usage.value` |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Abaikan | Baca sebagai ganti |\n"
"| --- | --- |\n"
"| `workloads[].usage.qpu_charge_time_seconds` | `workloads[].usage.value` |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If a workload is still running, `usage` is `null`.\n"
msgstr "Jika sesuatu beban kerja masih berjalan, `usage` ialah `null`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Function workloads {#function-workloads}"
msgstr "Beban kerja fungsi {#function-workloads}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The usage of a function workload is in RUs, the same as for a QPU workload. A function workload can use more than one metric:\n"
msgstr "Penggunaan beban kerja fungsi adalah dalam RU, sama seperti beban kerja QPU. Beban kerja fungsi boleh menggunakan lebih daripada satu metrik:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**QPU usage.** This is metered per second of quantum time. See [Execution modes](/guides/execution-modes).\n"
msgstr "**Penggunaan QPU.** Ini diukur bagi setiap saat masa kuantum. Lihat [Mod pelaksanaan](/guides/execution-modes).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Classical compute usage.** This is metered per second of [classical time](/guides/managed-workflow-compute-profiles).\n"
msgstr "**Penggunaan pengkomputeran klasik.** Ini diukur bagi setiap saat [masa klasik](/guides/managed-workflow-compute-profiles).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Execution license cost.** This is metered per workload, based on the [size of the problem passed to a function](/guides/functions#overview-of-available-functions).\n"
msgstr "**Kos lesen pelaksanaan.** Ini diukur bagi setiap beban kerja, berdasarkan [saiz masalah yang dihantar kepada fungsi](/guides/functions#overview-of-available-functions).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The platform converts the quantity of each metric to RUs. Thus, all usage values are in RUs:\n"
msgstr "Platform menukar kuantiti setiap metrik kepada RU. Oleh itu, semua nilai penggunaan adalah dalam RU:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`usage.value` is the usage of the workload, in RUs.\n"
msgstr "`usage.value` ialah penggunaan beban kerja, dalam RU.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`usage.details[].value` is the usage for one metric, in RUs.\n"
msgstr "`usage.details[].value` ialah penggunaan bagi satu metrik, dalam RU.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`usage.details[].metric.value` is the quantity of the metric, in the unit of that metric. It is not in RUs.\n"
msgstr "`usage.details[].metric.value` ialah kuantiti metrik, dalam unit metrik tersebut. Ia bukan dalam RU.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you show or add usage values, use `usage.value` and `usage.details[].value`. Do not use `usage.details[].metric.value`.\n"
msgstr "Jika anda memaparkan atau menjumlahkan nilai penggunaan, gunakan `usage.value` dan `usage.details[].value`. Jangan gunakan `usage.details[].metric.value`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Sessions {#sessions}"
msgstr "Session {#sessions}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Endpoints: `POST /v1/sessions` and `GET /v1/sessions/{id}`.\n"
msgstr "Endpoint: `POST /v1/sessions` dan `GET /v1/sessions/{id}`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Disregard | Read instead |\n"
"| --- | --- |\n"
"| `elapsed_time` (seconds) | `usage.value` |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Abaikan | Baca sebagai ganti |\n"
"| --- | --- |\n"
"| `elapsed_time` (saat) | `usage.value` |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The session `usage` object has `unit` and `details[]`. These fields work the same as in the job `usage` object, with the exception of the `status` field, which is omitted for sessions.\n"
msgstr "Objek `usage` session mempunyai `unit` dan `details[]`. Medan ini berfungsi sama seperti dalam objek `usage` kerja, kecuali medan `status`, yang tidak disertakan untuk session.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The fields `interactive_ttl`, `max_ttl`, and `active_ttl` do not change. They are time limits (TTL means \"time to live\"), not usage. Their unit stays seconds.\n"
msgstr "Medan `interactive_ttl`, `max_ttl` dan `active_ttl` tidak berubah. Ia ialah had masa (TTL bermaksud \"time to live\"), bukan penggunaan. Unitnya kekal saat.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Instance usage {#instance-usage}"
msgstr "Penggunaan instans {#instance-usage}"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Endpoint: `GET /v1/instances/usage`.\n"
msgstr "Endpoint: `GET /v1/instances/usage`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Disregard | Read instead |\n"
"| --- | --- |\n"
"| `usage_consumed_seconds` | `usage_consumed_ru` |\n"
"| `usage_limit_seconds` | `usage_limit_ru` |\n"
"| `usage_allocation_seconds` | `usage_allocation_ru` |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Abaikan | Baca sebagai ganti |\n"
"| --- | --- |\n"
"| `usage_consumed_seconds` | `usage_consumed_ru` |\n"
"| `usage_limit_seconds` | `usage_limit_ru` |\n"
"| `usage_allocation_seconds` | `usage_allocation_ru` |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The fields `usage_limit_reached`, `usage_period`, and `time_available_at` do not change.\n"
msgstr "Medan `usage_limit_reached`, `usage_period` dan `time_available_at` tidak berubah.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Account plans {#account-plans}"
msgstr "Pelan akaun {#account-plans}"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Endpoint: `GET /v1/accounts/{id}`.\n"
msgstr "Endpoint: `GET /v1/accounts/{id}`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Each item in `plans[]` has these changes:\n"
msgstr "Setiap item dalam `plans[]` mempunyai perubahan berikut:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Disregard | Read instead |\n"
"| --- | --- |\n"
"| `plans[].usage_limit_seconds` | `plans[].usage_limit_ru` |\n"
"| `plans[].usage_allocation_seconds` | `plans[].usage_allocation_ru` |\n"
"| `plans[].unallocated_usage_seconds` | `plans[].unallocated_usage_ru` |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Abaikan | Baca sebagai ganti |\n"
"| --- | --- |\n"
"| `plans[].usage_limit_seconds` | `plans[].usage_limit_ru` |\n"
"| `plans[].usage_allocation_seconds` | `plans[].usage_allocation_ru` |\n"
"| `plans[].unallocated_usage_seconds` | `plans[].unallocated_usage_ru` |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Service instances in the Resource Controller API {#service-instances-in-the-resource-controller-api}"
msgstr "Instans perkhidmatan dalam Resource Controller API {#service-instances-in-the-resource-controller-api}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The IBM Cloud&reg; Resource Controller API is a separate API. You use it to create and update service instances. If you create or update instances with this API, change the instance parameters too.\n"
msgstr "IBM Cloud&reg; Resource Controller API ialah API yang berasingan. Anda menggunakannya untuk mencipta dan mengemas kini instans perkhidmatan. Jika anda mencipta atau mengemas kini instans dengan API ini, ubah juga parameter instans.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "When you create or update an instance, send these parameters in the request:\n"
msgstr "Apabila anda mencipta atau mengemas kini instans, hantar parameter berikut dalam permintaan:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Don't send | Send instead | Type of the new parameter |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- |\n"
"| `instance_limit_seconds` | `instance_limit_ru` | Number or `null` |\n"
"| `usage_allocation_seconds` | `usage_allocation_ru` | Number or `null` |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Jangan hantar | Hantar sebagai ganti | Jenis parameter baharu |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- |\n"
"| `instance_limit_seconds` | `instance_limit_ru` | Nombor atau `null` |\n"
"| `usage_allocation_seconds` | `usage_allocation_ru` | Nombor atau `null` |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The parameters have these meanings:\n"
msgstr "Parameter tersebut mempunyai maksud berikut:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Instance limit**The maximum usage for the instance. If you do not send a limit on the Open Plan, the default is the RU equivalent of 10 minutes.\n"
msgstr "**Had instans**Penggunaan maksimum untuk instans. Jika anda tidak menghantar had pada Pelan Terbuka, nilai lalai ialah setara RU bagi 10 minit.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Usage allocation**: The share of usage for the instance. The fair-share scheduler uses this value to set the priority of the instance in the queue. The allocation does not apply to Pay-As-You-Go instances.\n"
msgstr "**Peruntukan penggunaan**: Bahagian penggunaan untuk instans. Penjadual bahagian adil menggunakan nilai ini untuk menetapkan keutamaan instans dalam giliran. Peruntukan tidak terpakai pada instans Pay-As-You-Go.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "When you read an instance, the `extensions` object in the response contains the old fields and the new fields. Disregard `instance_limit_seconds` and `usage_allocation_seconds`. Read `instance_limit_ru` and `usage_allocation_ru`.\n"
msgstr "Apabila anda membaca sesebuah instans, objek `extensions` dalam respons mengandungi medan lama dan medan baharu. Abaikan `instance_limit_seconds` dan `usage_allocation_seconds`. Baca `instance_limit_ru` dan `usage_allocation_ru`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For more information, see the [IBM Quantum Compute Service REST API documentation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-runtime-rest).\n"
msgstr "Untuk maklumat lanjut, lihat [dokumentasi REST API IBM Quantum Compute Service](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-runtime-rest).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Usage analytics {#usage-analytics}"
msgstr "Analitik penggunaan {#usage-analytics}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Endpoints: `GET /v1/analytics/usage`, `GET /v1/analytics/usage_grouped`, and `GET /v1/analytics/usage_grouped_by_date`.\n"
msgstr "Endpoint: `GET /v1/analytics/usage`, `GET /v1/analytics/usage_grouped` dan `GET /v1/analytics/usage_grouped_by_date`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The three endpoints have the same usage fields. The two grouped endpoints return these fields for each group or each date.\n"
msgstr "Ketiga-tiga endpoint mempunyai medan penggunaan yang sama. Kedua-dua endpoint berkumpulan mengembalikan medan ini bagi setiap kumpulan atau setiap tarikh.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The old analytics usage fields are in milliseconds, not seconds.\n"
msgstr "Medan penggunaan analitik lama adalah dalam milisaat, bukan saat.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Disregard (milliseconds) | Read instead (RUs) |\n"
"| --- | --- |\n"
"| `usage` | `usage_ru` |\n"
"| `sessions_usage` | `sessions_usage_ru` |\n"
"| `avg_sessions_usage` | `avg_sessions_usage_ru` |\n"
"| `max_sessions_usage` | `max_sessions_usage_ru` |\n"
"| `batch_sessions_usage` | `batch_sessions_usage_ru` |\n"
"| `avg_batch_sessions_usage` | `avg_batch_sessions_usage_ru` |\n"
"| `max_batch_sessions_usage` | `max_batch_sessions_usage_ru` |\n"
"| `dedicated_sessions_usage` | `dedicated_sessions_usage_ru` |\n"
"| `avg_dedicated_sessions_usage` | `avg_dedicated_sessions_usage_ru` |\n"
"| `max_dedicated_sessions_usage` | `max_dedicated_sessions_usage_ru` |\n"
"| `individual_jobs_usage` | `individual_jobs_usage_ru` |\n"
"| `avg_individual_jobs_usage` | `avg_individual_jobs_usage_ru` |\n"
"| `max_individual_jobs_usage` | `max_individual_jobs_usage_ru` |\n"
"| `functions_quantum_usage_ms` | `functions_quantum_usage_ru` |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Abaikan (milisaat) | Baca sebagai ganti (RU) |\n"
"| --- | --- |\n"
"| `usage` | `usage_ru` |\n"
"| `sessions_usage` | `sessions_usage_ru` |\n"
"| `avg_sessions_usage` | `avg_sessions_usage_ru` |\n"
"| `max_sessions_usage` | `max_sessions_usage_ru` |\n"
"| `batch_sessions_usage` | `batch_sessions_usage_ru` |\n"
"| `avg_batch_sessions_usage` | `avg_batch_sessions_usage_ru` |\n"
"| `max_batch_sessions_usage` | `max_batch_sessions_usage_ru` |\n"
"| `dedicated_sessions_usage` | `dedicated_sessions_usage_ru` |\n"
"| `avg_dedicated_sessions_usage` | `avg_dedicated_sessions_usage_ru` |\n"
"| `max_dedicated_sessions_usage` | `max_dedicated_sessions_usage_ru` |\n"
"| `individual_jobs_usage` | `individual_jobs_usage_ru` |\n"
"| `avg_individual_jobs_usage` | `avg_individual_jobs_usage_ru` |\n"
"| `max_individual_jobs_usage` | `max_individual_jobs_usage_ru` |\n"
"| `functions_quantum_usage_ms` | `functions_quantum_usage_ru` |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "These function fields are new. They have no old field in milliseconds:\n"
msgstr "Medan fungsi ini ialah medan baharu. Ia tidak mempunyai medan lama dalam milisaat:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`functions_usage_ru`\n"
msgstr "`functions_usage_ru`\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`avg_functions_usage_ru`\n"
msgstr "`avg_functions_usage_ru`\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`max_functions_usage_ru`\n"
msgstr "`max_functions_usage_ru`\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`functions_classical_usage_ru`\n"
msgstr "`functions_classical_usage_ru`\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`functions_license_cost_ru`\n"
msgstr "`functions_license_cost_ru`\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The total in `usage_ru` includes more than the total in `usage`:\n"
msgstr "Jumlah dalam `usage_ru` merangkumi lebih banyak daripada jumlah dalam `usage`:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`usage` is the sum of QPU time for sessions, individual jobs, and functions.\n"
msgstr "`usage` ialah jumlah masa QPU bagi session, kerja individu dan fungsi.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`usage_ru` is the sum of usage for sessions, individual jobs, and functions. For functions, it also includes classical compute and license cost.\n"
msgstr "`usage_ru` ialah jumlah penggunaan bagi session, kerja individu dan fungsi. Bagi fungsi, ia turut merangkumi pengkomputeran klasik dan kos lesen.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Thus, `usage_ru` is not only `usage` in a different unit.\n"
msgstr "Oleh itu, `usage_ru` bukan sekadar `usage` dalam unit yang berbeza.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The fields `queue_time`, `avg_queue_time`, and `max_queue_time` do not change. They measure wait time, not usage. Their unit stays milliseconds.\n"
msgstr "Medan `queue_time`, `avg_queue_time` dan `max_queue_time` tidak berubah. Ia mengukur masa menunggu, bukan penggunaan. Unitnya kekal milisaat.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Fields that do not change {#fields-that-do-not-change}"
msgstr "Medan yang tidak berubah {#fields-that-do-not-change}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "These fields contain time values, but they do not measure usage. IBM Quantum does not plan to replace them:\n"
msgstr "Medan ini mengandungi nilai masa, tetapi ia tidak mengukur penggunaan. IBM Quantum tidak merancang untuk menggantikannya:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`wait_time_seconds` on backends: The estimated wait in the queue.\n"
msgstr "`wait_time_seconds` pada backend: Anggaran masa menunggu dalam giliran.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`circuits_execution_time_ns` in `GET /v1/jobs/{id}/metrics`: The time that the job ran on the QPU.\n"
msgstr "`circuits_execution_time_ns` dalam `GET /v1/jobs/{id}/metrics`: Masa kerja tersebut berjalan pada QPU.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`interactive_ttl`, `max_ttl`, and `active_ttl` on sessions.\n"
msgstr "`interactive_ttl`, `max_ttl` dan `active_ttl` pada session.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`queue_time`, `avg_queue_time`, and `max_queue_time` in analytics.\n"
msgstr "`queue_time`, `avg_queue_time` dan `max_queue_time` dalam analitik.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`rep_times` and `circuit_duration` in backend configuration.\n"
msgstr "`rep_times` dan `circuit_duration` dalam konfigurasi backend.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Migration steps {#migration-steps}"
msgstr "Langkah penghijrahan {#migration-steps}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Find each old field in your code. Search for `qpu_charge_time_seconds`, `elapsed_time`, the `_seconds` fields in this guide, and the analytics fields in milliseconds.\n"
msgstr "Cari setiap medan lama dalam kod anda. Cari `qpu_charge_time_seconds`, `elapsed_time`, medan `_seconds` dalam panduan ini, dan medan analitik dalam milisaat.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Change each old field to the RU field in the tables of this guide.\n"
msgstr "Tukar setiap medan lama kepada medan RU dalam jadual panduan ini.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you create or update service instances with the Resource Controller API, send `instance_limit_ru` and `usage_allocation_ru`. Do not send the `_seconds` parameters.\n"
msgstr "Jika anda mencipta atau mengemas kini instans perkhidmatan dengan Resource Controller API, hantar `instance_limit_ru` dan `usage_allocation_ru`. Jangan hantar parameter `_seconds`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Change the labels in your user interface. Show \"RU\" or \"resource units\", not \"seconds\" or \"minutes\". Do not convert RUs to time. There is no fixed rate between RUs and time.\n"
msgstr "Ubah label dalam antara muka pengguna anda. Paparkan \"RU\" atau \"unit sumber\", bukan \"saat\" atau \"minit\". Jangan tukar RU kepada masa. Tiada kadar tetap antara RU dan masa.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '5. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you read `usage.details[]`, use `value` for the usage in RUs. Do not use `metric.value`, because its unit is the unit of the metric.\n"
msgstr "Jika anda membaca `usage.details[]`, gunakan `value` untuk penggunaan dalam RU. Jangan gunakan `metric.value`, kerana unitnya ialah unit metrik tersebut.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '6. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "If `usage.status` is `\"pending\"`, show the value as provisional.\n"
msgstr "Jika `usage.status` ialah `\"pending\"`, paparkan nilai tersebut sebagai sementara.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '7. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "If an RU field is missing or `null`, use the same logic that you use for the old field today.\n"
msgstr "Jika medan RU tiada atau `null`, gunakan logik yang sama seperti yang anda gunakan untuk medan lama pada hari ini.\n"
